// ChangeSubscription: Move a subscription to another plan version and/or interval, now or at the end of the
// paid period (POST /v1/subscriptions/{id}/change).
//
// An upgrade or monthly-to-yearly change is immediate and prorated; a downgrade or yearly-to-monthly change
// waits for the end of the period the customer has paid for (a scheduled change, shown on the subscription). A
// change of `quantity` alone is immediate and prorated, more seats or fewer. Whatever moves money is invoiced,
// or becomes a credit balance when the new plan costs less than the unused old time was worth. Answers 409
// `ABORTED` if the fee of the current period has not been invoiced yet; try again in a moment.
